WEBVTT

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.380
Gomez is here to pick you up, Ms. Revi.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.760
Thank you.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:47.690
Ondine. You must be happy your brother is here with you.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:01:00.910
Isn't it strange that even they have something that resembles emotion?

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:36.740
Hi.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.200
What do you mean "hi"?

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.830
You know what, Tsutomu?

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:48.920
You've been avoiding me since the other day, haven't you?

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:50.170
Well?

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.680
I guess there's no way of explaining that one.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:08.940
<i>Stupid! Stop it!</i>

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.250
Hey, uh... what's up, Natsumi?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.210
I'll be waiting outside the entrance of that amusement park at 10 tomorrow.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:38.840
I have lots of things to ask you, and I don't want to be ignored anymore.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.340
Hey, Natsumi!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.680
She's very persistent.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.520
What are you going to do now, Tsutomu?

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.100
Who knows...

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.310
Are you going to tell her the truth about us?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.810
How could I possibly explain all this to her?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:57.400
In this body, there is a completely separate personality...

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:02.240
...a Space Federation Officer who has come from a distant planet.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.490
Sure, haul me off to the loony bin.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.950
Then just forget about it.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.120
But I can't...

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.620
Why do you have to be so wishy-washy?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.000
What do you think?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.840
It looks all right... I guess...

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:25.850
...but these clothes - what if my sister finds out I borrowed her clothes?

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.270
Well, off to my patrols! See ya!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.160
There's no way you're going to find them here.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.250
I guess not. There are so many people.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.590
I can't figure out what Revi is up to.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:05.180
What could she want coming to a place like this?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:09.510
She's smart, so she won't let herself get caught easily.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.180
Who is this Revi person anyway?

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.400
According to our records, Christella Revi has been...

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:20.150
...regarded as a brilliant scientist since the beginning of the Federation.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.150
She was born in the Etane star system.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.610
She became Minister of Science at age 25.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:30.200
How could such a brilliant genius like that become a criminal?

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.620
Who knows.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.790
Maybe she has some kind of personal vendetta.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.380
What are you doing?

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.430
I'm very certain we're being followed.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:48.890
An Arkazoid?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:12.580
Yes. I've just been turned away every step of the way.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.660
Could be difficult...

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.870
I'll be back after I check out one other place...

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.340
All right... Good-bye.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.100
<i>Ticket Booths</i>

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.220
Hey, you there!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.640
I think you dropped this, Miss.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.900
Is this yours?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.490
That's right. Yes.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:49.240
Kuon High School, Grade 10, Class C, Tsutomu Senkawa?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.660
Oh, no! Let's get out of here!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.250
Thank you, Good-bye.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.080
Hey!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.300
B1
Shinjuku Metropolitan Line
2- Chome Intersection
<b>C7</b>
Tokyo Social Security Office

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.430
All right. Who are you?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.270
I've done nothing wrong.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.270
You look suspicious to me!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:22.190
How about a career in the entertainment business?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.690
You're very intriguing.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.280
Showbiz Productions?

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.700
It's a misunderstanding, Birdy.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.160
Oh, really?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:36.200
Sorry. It's a misunderstanding apparently. Bye.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.750
Hey, wait up!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.710
Don't you want to be a star?!

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.840
It tastes so much better...

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.920
...when I eat with my own body.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.220
But don't be eating 5 or <i>6 of those.</i>

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:03.980
Here.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.820
Thank you.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.780
What do you think you're doing?

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.660
Don't be attracting too much attention here.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.330
Welcome to the Wine Fair.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.870
<i>Sun Brewery NEWPRODUCT Wine Fair</i>

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:19.580
Feel free to enjoy the many selections.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.260
Ah, wonderful bouquet.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.010
You're under age! You can't drink!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.890
Ah, that was good!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.350
I'll get another.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:41.690
Stop it. What if you end up drunk?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.460
<i>Town Eight</i>

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:03.310
Shorten the time it takes to permeate the genetic structure.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:09.360
Strengthen the psy power by controlling the regeneration of the nervous system.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:13.280
We've met all the requirements for implementation.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.740
Then what happens to those test subjects?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:21.120
Not to worry. I've supplied an antidote, enough so they will recover easily.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.540
They won't remember a thing about what happened to them.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:28.130
What do you think?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.550
I'm looking forward to the next stage.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.550
Gomez. What are we going to do about that girl?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.640
You know who I'm talking about?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.020
How could you forget?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.020
What was she called again? Was it Birdy?

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:52.400
She's just a kid. She won't be able to interfere anymore.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.650
Ms. Revi is a perfectionist...

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.820
But until we carry out the serum project...

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.700
...we can't even let a pinprick interfere with us.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.540
I don't think we should go out of our way to get rid of her.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.460
You're too easy, the way you do things.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.460
Ms. Revi, please let me take care of her.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:16.050
No need for you to get involved directly.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.510
Come here, Ondine.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.690
We'll use this girl.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.950
Who would've thought. Getting caught up in an accident like this.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.910
This isn't an accident.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.000
Huh! What do you mean?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.420
What are you saying then?

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.460
What are you doing, Birdy?

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:11.060
Gomez, what do you think of Hikawa?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:17.690
I'll have to acknowledge that as a human, he possesses a very brilliant mind, but...

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:18.610
But?

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.610
I am concerned about his ability to complete the serum project.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.950
However, to determine the effect of the serum on humans...

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:27.290
We need more time.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:31.160
Hasn't he already proved that the serum is ready?

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:35.790
No, until we can reverse the process repeatedly, it's not ready.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:40.880
To continue with the project at this pace would be too risky.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.970
You seem to differ in your approaches.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.180
To be honest, that is correct.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:50.310
I cannot trust anyone who flagrantly does a demonstration like that.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:54.600
But you can't deny you are his accomplice.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.730
Unfortunately.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.740
For the time being, we'll leave it up to him.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.280
You will remain pleasant and cooperative.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:07.620
Fortunately, there were very few injuries...

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.830
But the potential for massive casualties was great...

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.040
And the construction company responsible for the building...

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.040
...has initiated an in-depth investigation.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.630
That's pretty scary.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.340
It sounds to me like they were one step away from disaster.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.140
Mother!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.720
Was someone wearing this?

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.730
These look like ice cream stains.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.940
Look. Right here, look at that.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.980
I'm just going out for a bit.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.610
Okay.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.810
See? Right?

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.940
Oh, that. You must have done that yourself.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:46.870
No way. I just had it cleaned the other day and haven't worn it since.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.280
Who could've...

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.950
I told you there'd be a problem.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.410
Tsutomu wouldn't wear women's clothes, would he?

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.750
Father! Don't say such a stupid thing.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.580
And you're just confused, Hazumi.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.630
No way!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.170
Hurry up, Tsutomu!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.420
Give me a break!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.970
That serum sample is being analyzed at the science ministry.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.010
We'll know soon what it is.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.270
It would be a disaster if your intuition is right.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.100
Yes.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.360
You must capture Revi as soon as you can.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:22.530
I realize it must be difficult to proceed with that body of yours.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:26.280
But right now, we can only rely on you.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.490
Yes. I understand.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:32.200
By the way, how are things going with your partner?

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.710
Please don't cause him too much trouble with your antics.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:43.340
Yes, that's right, I've been proceeding very very carefully in that regard.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.880
Yeah, right. What a bald-faced lie that is.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.510
Hey! What are you talking about!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.010
Everything's fine! Really.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.220
I'm sorry.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:53.520
Not at all.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.730
Not you. I'm talking to Tsutomu.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.440
You think Revi caused that accident?

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.190
I'm sure of it.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.110
We can't let her get away with it. We've gotta catch her.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.240
How? We don't have any good leads.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.700
And it's useless going to the police with this.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.540
That's right. By the way, what about your appointment today?

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:20.250
Huh?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.550
That girl. Natsumi Hayamiya?

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.050
Oh, yeah. I forgot.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.220
Amusement park. I just don't really feel like it.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:36.470
Oh, is that so. I understand. Thank you very much.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.900
She's already left.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.900
I guess I'll just have to go.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.070
What a drag. It's raining.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.450
<i>Josai Kita Police Department</i>
<i>Thanks for your smiles</i> <i>and your cooperation!</i>

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.740
What do you mean, Yamazaki?

00:14:56.870 --> 00:15:02.670
I hear one of your boys has been looking for wartime research scientists.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:06.670
Has someone from above spoken to you?

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:11.010
I'm sure you're aware that this is a very delicate matter.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.310
You're going to have to be much more careful.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.680
Do you have anything to connect those people...

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:21.390
to that mysterious mutation incident in Ikebukuro? You know what I mean.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.980
Well...

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:31.320
Yamazaki, I don't know if I can hold them back this time.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:36.530
Understand that I'm just concerned about the criminal motive.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.910
Motive?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.170
The motive behind creating such a mutant.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.920
In this age of hi-tuck...

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.670
You mean, hi-tech?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:48.000
Huh? Yes, of course, right...

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:53.090
In this age of hi-tech, who would be interested in research on...

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.680
...developing humans with a greater fighting capacity?

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:01.520
There's just something out of this world about it.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:06.820
I noticed your name was listed in the graduate roster for 1930...

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.190
...of the Medical Department at the Imperial University.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.570
Know anything about it?

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.860
We know that many graduates were posted to that unit.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.200
I know that you didn't mention that when we discussed it.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.960
And I'm sure there were some who were involved in that research.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.880
Damn, I cut too much off.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:36.760
<i>ENTRANCE</i>
<i>Today's Business Hours: 10 AM - 5 PM</i>

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:46.060
Just look at this. What a lousy day to come to an amusement park.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.530
What's up with her?

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.580
What is it now?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.170
What if Natsumi sees us?

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:13.130
That girl. She may be cute, but she's no human.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.170
What?

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.270
Hello. You do remember me, don't you?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:29.980
What do you want?

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.650
Actually, I wanted to thank you for something.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:37.280
It was very gracious of you to help me out with my experiment.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.280
Because of you, I was able to improve the potency of my potion.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.160
Yesterday's accident?

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.290
Accident? Oh yes, it certainly was.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:50.960
I'm glad that you survived. But next time, it could be far worse.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:56.300
Who are you anyway? Serving Revi even though you are human.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:18:00.220
Let's see. You could say I found someone who shared my vision...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:04.270
...and who just happened to be a powerful alien. That's about it.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.980
Doesn't seem like a very positive vision.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.810
Wasn't there something else you could have done?

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:13.610
That's what genius is all about.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.950
It doesn't look like much at first, but people will soon notice.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.530
Because it is that genius which will open the doors to a bright future.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.870
Well, I wonder...

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.870
That's right. Well, I'm very busy, so I bid you farewell.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:34.800
Next time I want to hear all the rest of your amazing stories.

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:40.840
Very funny. But unfortunately, there will be no next time for you.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.150
Pretty tough.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.580
Ok, now let's just see how much you can handle.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.380
She's fast.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.620
Where did she go?

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:01.590
You!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:12.190
You're not like any Arkazoid I've ever seen before.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.350
A new challenge can be good.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.810
This is nothing to scoff at!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.980
You did great, Birdy!

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.860
Where is he?

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.870
How dare he make a girl wait this long in the rain!

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:52.830
That's it, he's the worst.

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.170
What is it with this girl? Not a scratch on her!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:05.880
Couldn't be.

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:09.430
There. She's starting to fall apart.

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:12.260
You're right.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:18.100
Can't we just electrocute her with a high voltage current?

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.060
You make it sound so easy.

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.190
Well, it's right up there.

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:29.410
I wish you could have thought about that sooner.

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.490
I think you're just a little slow.

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:53.510
Ok. Come right in, little girl.

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:28.630
That Revi sure wants to make a horror out of this.

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:34.300
Using the image of a young girl like this as a combat weapon.

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.470
Despicable.

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:49.860
Stop it, Birdy!

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:03.080
It's over now.

00:24:23.140 --> 00:24:25.020
I'm exhausted.

00:24:33.780 --> 00:24:39.830
It started to rain, so I had to go back to get an umbrella.

00:24:39.910 --> 00:24:41.500
That's why I'm late.

00:24:42.620 --> 00:24:44.500
I see.

00:24:51.090 --> 00:24:52.380
Tsutomu...

00:24:54.430 --> 00:24:56.890
Who are you anyway?

00:24:58.720 --> 00:25:02.100
Who was that girl you just transformed from?

00:25:02.180 --> 00:25:03.390
Who is she?!

00:25:08.230 --> 00:25:11.070
I don't intend to tell you a thing about this.

00:25:13.030 --> 00:25:15.450
It's better that you don't know.

00:25:16.570 --> 00:25:18.240
What do you mean?

00:25:20.370 --> 00:25:24.710
Don't ask me anymore. I can't tell you.

00:25:29.880 --> 00:25:31.800
I understand.

00:25:32.760 --> 00:25:38.300
I'm not so stupid to force you to say something that you don't want to.

00:25:38.470 --> 00:25:39.970
Let's just forget it.

00:25:49.270 --> 00:25:52.020
You don't want to catch cold now, do you?

00:25:53.360 --> 00:25:55.700
I'll be waiting...

00:25:55.780 --> 00:26:00.030
...until you feel you can tell me everything on your own.

00:26:02.870 --> 00:26:05.160
Is it OK if I wait?

00:26:16.630 --> 00:26:17.840
Let's go.

00:26:43.490 --> 00:26:45.370
What's wrong, Salamander?

00:26:47.250 --> 00:26:51.040
Ondine is damaged badly, it seems, and is no longer operating.

00:26:54.880 --> 00:26:57.340
And she was such a cute girl.

00:27:04.430 --> 00:27:05.100
<i>Investigations</i>

00:27:05.640 --> 00:27:08.100
Lieutenant! I've finally found him!

00:27:09.270 --> 00:27:11.100
The one responsible for those experiments.

00:27:11.560 --> 00:27:12.520
It's this man.

00:27:14.900 --> 00:27:17.860
This is a picture of Unit 942 in the Imperial Army.

00:27:17.900 --> 00:27:22.660
Seichiro Hikawa, Second Lieutenant, 24 years old at the time.

00:27:24.530 --> 00:27:27.830
He'd be about 80 if he were alive today.

00:28:08.450 --> 00:28:11.750
Suddenly we meet by accident

00:28:14.670 --> 00:28:19.130
My heart is susceptible to getting caught

00:28:21.510 --> 00:28:26.930
Whether it be by road or jet, I will dash out

00:28:26.930 --> 00:28:31.890
Hey go go, Okay go go girl

00:28:33.520 --> 00:28:37.150
I absolutely will not let go

00:28:40.030 --> 00:28:44.200
I will take you by force

00:28:46.870 --> 00:28:52.620
running to the amusement park

00:28:52.870 --> 00:28:55.880
Follow me

00:28:58.210 --> 00:29:02.260
That's right, <i>Future Shock</i>, to you...

00:29:02.260 --> 00:29:05.470
<i>Future Shock</i>, dashing around

00:29:05.470 --> 00:29:11.640
<i>Future Shock</i>, don't say that you don't understand me

00:29:11.640 --> 00:29:14.810
I want you to stay with me

00:29:14.940 --> 00:29:19.900
Let's find the same thrill
